```js
var a = typeof undefined;
var b = typeof null;
var c = typeof 1;
var d = typeof function(){};
```

下列代码的打印结果为（　）？
```js
function isObject(v) {
  return typeof v === 'object';
}
console.log(isObject(null), isObject([]), isObject({}));
```

